{"source":"The choir rehearsal was meant to be a tidy forty minutes. We had a list, a starting pitch, and a perfectly reasonable plan to go home before the caretaker did her final round. Then somebody asked whether we could try the last verse again. Somebody else found a second harmony, and suddenly we had three opinions about where to breathe. None of them seemed wrong. We kept saying, one more time, and meaning it every time.

By the time the caretaker flicked the lights, we had lost track of the clock. Nobody was in trouble; she just wanted to lock up. We packed our folders and sang the final chord out on the steps, where it sounded much better than it had any right to. A couple of people walking past stopped until we finished. I hope we keep that version, though I can't explain how we got there. I have written a few notes in the margin of my music, mostly question marks. Maybe that will be enough to find it again next week.","candidate":"The choir rehearsal was meant to be a tidy forty minutes. We had a list, a starting pitch, and a perfectly reasonable plan to go home before the caretaker did her final round. Then somebody asked whether we could try the last verse again. Somebody else found a second harmony, and suddenly we had three opinions about where to breathe. None of them seemed wrong. We kept saying "one more time," and meaning it every time.

By the time the caretaker flicked the lights, we had lost track of the clock. Nobody was in trouble; she just wanted to lock up. We packed our folders and sang the final chord out on the steps, where it sounded much better than it had any right to. A couple of people walking past stopped and waited until we finished. I hope we keep that version, though I can't explain how we got there. I've written a few notes in the margin of my music, mostly question marks. Maybe that will be enough to find it again next week.","objective":"Smooth any clunky spots for a community blog. Keep the conversational rhythm and the slightly amused ending.","deterministicFindings":[],"authorizedChanges":[],"voiceDeviations":[],"protectedPhrases":["before the caretaker","more time"]}

